W:The boar's head in hand bear I
W:Bedecked with bays and rosemary;
W:And I pray you, my masters, be merry,
W:Quot estis in convivio:
W:
W:Caput apri defero, Reddens laudes Domino.
W:Caput apri defero, Reddens laudes Domino.

